    <artifactId>homing-ui-specimens</artifactId>
    <description>
        The house's components in action: a specimen for every leaf of the house's
        taxonomy that has a realization - the component built live, its behaviour
        exercised and said, and the axes its leaf varies along set by number. Which
        leaves have a specimen, which are realized with one still to come, and which
        nothing realizes yet, is one declaration, held against the house's taxonomy.
    </description>
